**Type P1 · Independent Tag**
$$\exists\,\Phi:D^2\to D \text{ 固定},\ \exists\psi_q:\Phi_{a,b}=\psi_{F_0(a,b)}^{-1}\circ\Phi\circ(\psi_a\times\psi_b).$$
